WEBVTT

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:14.060
Wait. Are you going to 
abandon Min-chan and me?

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:17.070
I've had enough of having my life

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.020
being dictated by you and our child!

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.780
I'm sick of it!

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.030
I've got things I want to do, too!

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:30.290
Is Mom never coming back?

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.790
That's not it.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:35.010
She's just going on a long trip.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.860
Did she abandon me?

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.720
No, she'll be back soon.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.360
With plenty of souvenirs for you—

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:43.370
L-Lies!

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:44.920
I heard everything!

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:48.070
Mom abandoned me because of you!

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:51.270
You lied about protecting Mom and me!

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:52.340
Give Mom back!

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:54.010
Mom!

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.350
I want to see Mom!

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:04.630
You wanna go, transfer student?

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:05.890
Super annoying.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.200
Get her!

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.520
Let's go!

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:16.430
Min-chan!

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.670
What'd you come here for?

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:22.030
Sensei called me to school.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.950
Said it was urgent.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:26.660
Did something happen?

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.890
Another fight?

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.690
Leave me alone.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:32.740
I can look out for myself.

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.680
Is this the Earthling that seduced my son?

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:45.230
A-Are you an alien?

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.480
At least she's female.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.020
But I have no interest in women anymore.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.960
All the women who got involved

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:54.810
with me ended up in misfortune.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.190
You'll vanish from this 
world before long, too—

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.040
Annoying!

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.140
Lacking!

00:03:11.140 --> 00:03:12.740
Horrifically lacking!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:15.800
Don't die just yet.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:18.900
You have to see how I massacre 
all the Earthlings.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:22.610
I'll take my time killing you after that.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.200
Man, my head hurts.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.580
This planet's booze is some crazy shit.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:29.550
Just one sip made me blank out.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:31.150
I drank too much.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:32.040
Min-chan?

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.540
What's wrong, Min-chan?!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.330
Hey!

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:35.940
Morning Yamada!

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.870
Min-chan! Min-chan!

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:39.440
Min-chan...

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.110
Hang in there, Min-chan!

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:43.970
Min-chan! Min-chan!

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:45.280
Hang in there!

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:51.830
D-Daddy...

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.540
You still can't come home?

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.190
Can't say I appreciate checking your 
phone during a business dinner.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.540
Min-chan has a seafood allergy!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:55.540
She's in a lot of pain.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:03:59.150
I apologize.

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:01.450
You have it good for someone so young.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:04.430
Calls and texts... 
You're more popular than us.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:09.520
Wife
calling

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:06.410
I'm really sorry!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:09.520
It's one of those Nigerian prince scam callers. 
I'll switch it off right away.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.930
It's your wife, right?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.250
Maybe it's urgent.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:13.250
Take the call.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.550
Hello? I'm working, damn it!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.500
Stop—

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.360
What? Is she that sick?!

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:21.680
Taxi!

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.450
Hey, stop!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.100
Hey!

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.860
Why can't I get through 
to the taxi company?!

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:32.010
You knew about Min-chan's allergy!

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:34.290
Why'd you feed her chirimenjako!

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.820
It's got prawns in it!

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.310
Daddy...

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:40.100
Daddy...

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.940
Hang in there, Min-chan! 
You can't die!

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.040
If you do, I die with you!

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:48.340
I won't die, damn it!

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:50.370
You're alive? Thank goodness!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.880
Who was it? Beatles was it?!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.020
Who made my waifu—

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.300
That was a good one, Moemoe.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.990
F-F-F-Father?!

00:04:58.990 --> 00:04:59.820
W-What are you doing here?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:03.220
Come back already, you useless brats.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.110
Give me another chance, Father!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.630
My plan is one step away from fruition.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:10.400
My disguise skill is perfect!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.250
Nobody has noticed who I am.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.120
I can completely erase 
this planet's superhero.

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:16.800
Perfect, my ass.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.100
The moment the "Shit, Shit, Come Out" 
spell didn't work on you,

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.500
it was obvious you weren't an Earthling!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:24.360
Impossible!

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:27.090
My rubrub transformation 
ability is flawless.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.860
I can look like anyone I want!

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:31.060
Father knows!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.770
He remembers all those lonely 
nights he called me to his room,

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.920
made me transform into all sorts of women,

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:38.810
and stay with him all night!

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:41.910
Even if you were just trying to get 
ahead, that's fucked up.

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:45.190
That's right. I am flawless perfection—

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.030
SHADDUP!

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.740
Don't reveal that!

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:52.740
Moemoe, too.

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.030
Your horsing around ends here.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.960
We're leaving at once.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:59.330
No. I'm staying here with Min-chan.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.840
Ridiculous!

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:04.450
Your little brother is dead, and your older brother
is useless and a crossdresser.

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:06.970
You must inherit the throne and

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:09.340
conquer the entire universe 
in the near future!

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:11.850
For the sake of the universe and mine.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.550
Sorry, Min-chan.

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.240
I've got sudden plans.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.740
Let's go to the beach some other time.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.880
It's all for the company's sake.

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:29.440
For the sake of themselves, 
companies, and universes...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.200
Everyone's so selfish.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.160
No.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.550
I don't care about the throne.

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:37.470
I'd rather stay with Min-chan.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.350
This place is tiny, but warm.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:44.280
When I met Min-chan, I found out about 
this warmth and came to love them both.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.960
This is the home I seek!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.470
Hey, wake up already! 
It's showtime!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.800
Huh? Time for the last train already?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.830
Well said!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:03.390
You've become a man, son.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:07.110
Then take responsibility 
for the future yourself.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:10.300
Father! Thank you for understanding!

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:12.990
The danger has passed, Min-chan!

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.780
Now Earth is totally safe!

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:19.050
Moemoe, were you listening to what I said?

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.000
I said take responsibility yourself!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:40.240
If you like this place so much,

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.530
fertilize its soil with your corpse!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.780
Oh, no! It's all coming down!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.780
Wait, he's still over there!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:52.400
You can't! Fatty will be fine!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.050
No! Don't touch me!

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.510
Down we go!

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:55.570
I'm on it!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:03.000
What would a brat like you know?

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.300
Earthlings have short lifespans.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:10.810
You will have to endure limitless 
sorrow when you're left behind.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.200
Control Center!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.090
Warp us to the ship!

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.100
And bring this planet to ruin!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:19.900
No way! A light speed EM cannon?!

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:21.640
And the story's entering the climax!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.520
This is bad!

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:26.610
It's the perfect scene for the superhero 
to make his belated entrance.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:33.280
I take a nap, and I feel like 
I've been beaten black and blue.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:35.290
And the apartment complex is gone.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:39.210
Wow, did I fall from the third floor? 
Being immortal is crazy.

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.920
Hey you, the big asshole!

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:43.710
Who are you?

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:44.930
That doesn't matter.

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.870
How dare you do this to my home? 
There's nothing left!

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.210
You'll pay!

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.050
<b>Your ass is grass,
and I'm gonna smoke it!</b>

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.050
Your ass is grass, and I'm gonna smoke it!

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:56.410
Oh, wow. Are you an ass man, superhero?

00:08:58.820 --> 00:09:01.200
You even broke my toilet!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:03.770
This is but the beginning.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.070
What I want to destroy 
is this entire planet!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.720
Dude, don't tell me...

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:13.340
Your wife cucked you and had another 
man's child, and now you're mad?

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:13.530
<b>Wife Cucked You</b>

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.530
<b>Another Man's Child</b>

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.530
<b>Mad</b>

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:15.020
N-Now that you know my secret,

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:17.520
I'll have to erase you, 
leaving not a speck behind!

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:18.160
Wow, bull's-eye?

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.950
<b>Tenth Day as a Superhero "This Episode Is Low on Laughs and Salt Content"</b>

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:20.660
This episode is low on 
comedy and salt content.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:27.480
Taking a closer look, 
your face really pisses me off.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:30.960
Show me what you've got, superhero!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:34.170
Piss off already!

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:46.230
W-What just happened?

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:50.020
My all-out hit bore no fruit. 
He didn't even pant.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:51.600
Fruit panties?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.010
Wearable and edible?

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.570
Man, I still don't really get it.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.900
Just what is my superpower?
